---
import HyperGamerX from "../../../public/logos/hyperGamerX.svg";
import HyperGamerXLetter from "../../../public/logos/hyperGamerXLetter.svg";
import { FOOTER, NETWORKS } from "@src/data";
---

<footer class="flex flex-col bg-full-black text-full-white gap-2.5 xl:gap-6 px-2.5 py-2.5 md:px-7 md:py-3 lg:px-10 lg:py-5 xl:px-24 xl:py-9">
  <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 self-stretch">
    <HyperGamerX class="w-8 h-8 md:w-12 md:h-12 lg:w-16 lg:h-16" aria-hidden="true" />
    <HyperGamerXLetter class="w-52.5 md:w-55 lg:w-85 xl:w-100 h-auto aspect-189/20" aria-hidden="true" />
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 grid-rows-2 lg:grid-rows-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-4 lg:gap-12">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
      <p>Descubre las últimas noticias y curiosidades en el mundo de los videojuegos. Reseñas, avances, análisis y más, HyperGamerX tu fuente de información.</p>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
        <p class="font-bold text-primary">Redes</p>
        <div class="flex gap-x-2 md:gap-x-2 lg:gap-x-3 xl:gap-x-5">
          {
            NETWORKS.map((network) => (
              <a href={network.url} aria-label={`Visitar HyperGamerX en ${network.name}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-primary focus-visible:text-primary transition-colors">
                <network.icon class="rounded w-8 h-8" aria-hidden="true" />
              </a>
            ))
          }
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <nav aria-label="Navegación del pie de página" class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      {
        FOOTER.map((item) => {
          return (
            <div>
              <p class="w-full font-bold text-primary">{item.title}</p>
              <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2">
                {item.items.map((link) => {
                  const isActive = Astro.url.pathname === link.href;
                  if (link.href === "cookies")
                    return (
                      <li>
                        <button type="button" data-cc="show-preferencesModal" transition:persist class="flex items-center gap-0.5 w-full text-left cursor-pointer text-full-white/70 transition-colors hover:text-primary focus-visible:text-primary">
                          {link.name}
                        </button>
                      </li>
                    );
                  return (
                    <li>
                      <a href={link.href} aria-current={isActive ? "page" : undefined} class:list={["flex items-center gap-0.5 w-full font-xs text-full-white/70 transition-colors focus-visible:text-primary", isActive ? "text-primary" : "hover:text-primary"]}>
                        {link.name}
                      </a>
                    </li>
                  );
                })}
              </ul>
            </div>
          );
        })
      }
    </nav>
  </div>

  <p class="text-full-white/70">
    ©2026 - HyperGamerX - TODOS LOS DERECHOS RESERVADOS. CREADO POR{" "}<a href="https://brayan-cordova.vercel.app/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="underline hover:text-primary focus-visible:text-primary transition-colors">BRAYAN CORDOVA</a>
  </p>
</footer>
